### 1) strana 2 od 3 -> 200, items: Proizvod 06..10, totalCount 12, totalPages 3,
###    hasNext true, hasPrevious true; isti podaci u zaglavlju X-Pagination
GET https://localhost:7150/api/v1/products?page=2&pageSize=5

### 2) kategorija + sort -> 200, totalCount 4, prvi "Proizvod 12" (12000), poslednji "Proizvod 03"
GET https://localhost:7150/api/v1/products?categoryId=1&sort=price_desc

### 3) cena 5000-9000 -> 200, totalCount 5 (Proizvod 05..09)
GET https://localhost:7150/api/v1/products?minPrice=5000&maxPrice=9000

### 4) pretraga -> 200, totalCount 3 (Proizvod 10, 11, 12)
GET https://localhost:7150/api/v1/products?search=Proizvod%201

### 5) preveliki pageSize -> 200, "pageSize": 100, dvanaest stavki, totalPages 1
GET https://localhost:7150/api/v1/products?pageSize=1000

### 6) nedozvoljen sort -> 400, type .../errors/validation, errors.sort sa spiskom polja
GET https://localhost:7150/api/v1/products?sort=weight

### 7) stara ruta bez verzije -> 404
GET https://localhost:7150/api/products

### 8) nova kategorija -> 201, Location: /api/v1/categories/4
POST https://localhost:7150/api/v1/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Kablovi", "slug": "kablovi" }

### 9) isti slug -> 409, type .../errors/duplicate-slug
POST https://localhost:7150/api/v1/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Kablovi i adapteri", "slug": "kablovi" }

### 10) izmena -> 204; brisanje prazne -> 204
PUT https://localhost:7150/api/v1/categories/4
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Kablovi i adapteri", "slug": "kablovi-adapteri" }

